.SH "نام (NAME)"
auto-multiple-choice-getimages \- prepares scan images before sending them to \fBauto-multiple-choice-analyse\fR(1) for analysis
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBauto\-multiple\-choice\fR\ 'u
\fBauto\-multiple\-choice\fR getimages [\-\-copy\-to\ \fIproject\-scans\-dir\fR] [\-\-vector\-density\ \fIdensity\fR] \-\-list\ \fIlist\-file\fR [\fIscan\-files\fR...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The
\fBauto\-multiple\-choice getimages\fR
command prepares scan files before sending them to
\fBauto-multiple-choice-analyse\fR(1):
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.sp -1
.IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
multipage image files are split to get one file per page\&.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.sp -1
.IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
vector images (such as PDF, EPS) are converted to bitmap images\&.
.RE
.PP
The input images can be given either as arguments to
\fBauto\-multiple\-choice getimages\fR, either as the name of a file which contains all the paths of the scan files\&.
.PP
\fB\-\-list \fR\fB\fIlist\-file\fR\fR
.RS 4
gives the name of the file that optionally contains (one per line) the paths of the scan files\&. This file will be cleared and filled with the paths of the scan files after processing, so that the same path can be passed to
\fBauto\-multiple\-choice analyse\fR
as the
\fB\-\-list\-fichiers\fR
option value\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-copy\-to \fR\fB\fIproject\-scans\-dir\fR\fR
.RS 4
gives a directory where to copy all the scans files\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-vector\-density \fR\fB\fIdensity\fR\fR
.RS 4
sets the density used to convert vector graphics scans to bitmap files\&. Defaults to 300\&.
.RE
